   "id": "q0599",
   "category": "Scala",
   "type": "理论",
   "question": "1 导学 · 9.6 IndexedSeq☆☆",
   "answer": "这种类型的主要访问方式是通过索引，**默认的实现方式为Vector**\n\n**备注：**这里的IndexedSeq是immutable包下的，相关联的还有Array和String\n\nobject Third {\n  def main(args: Array[String]): Unit = {\n    val x = *IndexedSeq*(1,2,3)\n    *println*(x.getClass)\n    *println*(x(0))\n\n    val y = *Range*(1, 5)\n    *println*(y)\n\n  }\n}",
   "source": "api\\scale\\Scala文档.md"
