   "id": "q0615",
   "category": "Scala",
   "type": "理论",
   "question": "1 导学 · 10.3匹配常量☆☆",
   "answer": "Scala 中，模式匹配可以匹配所有的字面量，包括字符串，字符，数字，布尔值等等。\n\ndef describe(x: Any) = x match {\n  case 1 => \"one\"\n  case \"hello\" => \"hello\"\n  case true => \"true\"\n  case '+' => \"+\"\n  case _ => \"Else\"\n}",
