   "answer": "object Third {\n  def main(args: Array[String]): Unit = {\n    val (x, y) = (1, 2)\n    *println*(s\"x=**$**x,y=**$**y\")\n\n    //这里_*不能用其他代替，否则会出现不匹配的情况，如果向匹配可以用::\n    val *Array*(aaa, bbb, _*) = *Array*(1, 7, 2, 9)\n    *println*(s\"aaa=**$**aaa,bbb=**$**bbb\")\n  }\n}",
