   "id": "q0768",
   "category": "数仓",
   "type": "理论",
   "question": "腾讯视频倾斜诊断工具 · SQL改写优化",
   "answer": "**Map端JOIN优化**:\n\n代码块\n\n**折叠代码块**\n\n**复制**\n\n`-- 小表Map端JOIN\nSET hive.auto.convert.join=true;\nSET hive.mapjoin.smalltable.filesize=25000000;     -- 25MB小表阈值\nSELECT /*+ MAPJOIN(small_table)\n*/ large_table.*\n, small_table.advertiser_name\nFROM large_table JOIN small_table\nON large_table.advertiser_id = small_table.advertiser_id\n``WHERE large_table.imp_date = '20240513';`\n\n**随机数分散大Key**:\n\n代码块\n\n**折叠代码块**\n\n**复制**\n\n`-- 两阶段聚合解决倾斜\nSELECT advertiser_id, SUM(partial_sum) as total_income\nFROM (\n    SELECT advertiser_id,\n FLOOR(RAND() * 10) as bucket,           -- 添加随机桶 SUM(income_amount) as partial_sum\n    FROM ads_pub_ad_stone_roc_single_df    WHERE imp_date = '20240513'\n    GROUP BY advertis_id, FLOOR(RAND() * 10)       -- 第一阶段聚合\n) t\n``GROUP BY advertiser_id;                            -- 第二阶段聚合`\n\n**分桶处理倾斜**:\n\n代码块\n\n**折叠代码块**\n\n**复制**\n\n`-- 使用分桶表处理倾斜\nCREATE TABLE bucketed_table (\n    advertiser_id STRING,\n    income_amount DECIMAL(18,2)\n) CLUSTERED BY (advertiser_id) INTO 32 BUCKETS    -- 32个桶\nSTORED AS ORC;\n-- 分桶JOIN优化\nSET hive.optimize.bucketmapjoin=true;\n``SET hive.optimize.bucketmapjoin.sortedmerge=true;`",
   "source": "api\\商业化整体大梳理\\数据倾斜.md"
