   "category": "数仓",
   "type": "理论",
   "question": "腾讯视频倾斜诊断工具 · 案例3: JOIN操作倾斜",
   "answer": "**问题场景**:\n\n>\n\n**优化方案**:\n\n代码块\n\n**折叠代码块**\n\n**复制**\n\n`-- JOIN倾斜优化：Map端JOIN + 随机数\nSELECT    a.advertiser_id,\n    b.advertiser_name,\n    SUM(a.income_amount) as total_income\nFROM (\n    SELECT advertiser_id,\n        income_amount,\n        -- 为可能倾斜的键添加随机后缀 CASE WHEN advertiser_id IN ('热点广告主1', '热点广告主2')\n             THEN CONCAT(advertiser_id, '_', CAST(RAND()*5 AS INT))\n             ELSE advertiser_id END as join_key FROM ads_pub_ad_stone_roc_single_df WHERE imp_date = '20240513'\n) a\nJOIN (\n    SELECT advertiser_id,\n        advertiser_name,\n        -- 小表侧也做相应处理 CASE WHEN advertiser_id IN ('热点广告主1', '热点广告主2')\n             THEN CONCAT(advertiser_id, '_', CAST(RAND()*5 AS INT))\n             ELSE advertiser_id END as join_key FROM dim_pub_ad_advertiser_info_df\n) b ON a.join_key = b.join_key\n``GROUP BY a.advertiser_id, b.advertiser_name;`",
