   "type": "理论",
   "question": "腾讯视频倾斜诊断工具 · 动态参数调整",
   "answer": "**基于数据量的动态优化**:\n\n代码块\n\n**折叠代码块**\n\n**复制**\n\n`-- 根据数据量动态设置参数\nSET hivevar:data_size=(\n    SELECT COUNT(*)\n    FROM ads_pub_ad_stone_roc_single_df WHERE imp_date = '20240513'\n);\n-- 动态设置Reduce数量\nSET hive.exec.reducers.bytes.per.reducer=256000000;\nSET hive.exec.reducers.max=CASE\n    WHEN\n``{hivevar:data_size} > 10000000 THEN 500 ELSE 200 END;\n-- 动态设置内存SET mapreduce.reduce.memory.mb=CASE\n    WHEN\n``{hivevar:data_size} > 10000000 THEN 8192\n``    ELSE 4096 END;`",
