   "id": "q0775",
   "category": "数仓",
   "type": "理论",
   "question": "腾讯视频倾斜诊断工具 · 倾斜检测SQL",
   "answer": "**实时倾斜检测**:\n\n代码块\n\n**折叠代码块**\n\n**复制**\n\n`-- 检测当前任务的倾斜情况\nSELECT\n    reducer_id,\n    COUNT(*) as record_count,\n    AVG(record_count) OVER() as avg_count,\n    record_count / AVG(record_count) OVER() as skew_ratio\nFROM (\n    SELECT advertiser_id,\n        COUNT(*) as record_count,\n        HASH(advertiser_id) % 100 as reducer_id  -- 模拟Reducer分配 FROM ads_pub_ad_stone_roc_single_df WHERE imp_date = '20240513'\n    GROUP BY advertiser_id\n) t\nGROUP BY reducer_id\n``HAVING skew_ratio > 3.0;  -- 倾斜阈值3倍`\n\n**历史倾斜分析**:\n\n代码块\n\n**折叠代码块**\n\n**复制**\n\n`-- 分析历史倾斜模式\nSELECT\n    imp_date,\n    advertiser_id,\n    COUNT(\n`*`) as daily_records,\n    AVG(COUNT(\n`*`)) OVER(PARTITION BY imp_date) as avg_daily,\n    COUNT(\n*) / AVG(COUNT(*\n)) OVER(PARTITION BY imp_date) as daily_skew_ratio\nFROM ads_pub_ad_stone_roc_single_df\nWHERE imp_date BETWEEN '20240501' AND '20240507'\nGROUP BY imp_date, advertiser_id\nHAVING daily_skew_ratio > 5.0\n``ORDER BY daily_skew_ratio DESC;`",
   "source": "api\\商业化整体大梳理\\数据倾斜.md"
