   "answer": "**商业化核心表主键定义**:\n\n代码块\n\n**折叠代码块**\n\n**复制**\n\n`-- 广告收入表主键\n主键组合: imp_date + advertiser_id + project_code + xs_buying_type + xs_terminal_type\n-- ROC收入表主键\n主键组合: imp_date + content_id + category_id + scene_type + terminal_type\n-- 招商收入表主键\n``主键组合: imp_date + merchant_id + project_id + resource_type`\n\n**去重SQL示例**:\n\n代码块\n\n**折叠代码块**\n\n**复制**\n\n`-- 基于业务主键去重\nSELECT DISTINCT imp_date, advertiser_id, project_code, xs_buying_type, xs_terminal_type,\n    execution_income, order_income, estimate_income\nFROM ads_pub_ad_ams_execution_income_df\n``WHERE imp_date = '20240513'`",
