   "category": "数仓",
   "type": "理论",
   "question": "数据重复问题的来源分析 · 窗口函数去重策略",
   "answer": "**保留最新记录策略**:\n\n代码块\n\n**折叠代码块**\n\n**复制**\n\n`-- 按时间戳保留最新记录\nSELECT * FROM (\n    SELECT *,\n        ROW_NUMBER() OVER (\n            PARTITION BY advertiser_id, project_code, xs_buying_type\n            ORDER BY update_timestamp DESC, data_timestamp DESC ) as rn\n    FROM dws_pub_ad_ams_execution_income_df\n    WHERE imp_date = '20240513'\n``) WHERE rn = 1`\n\n**保留最完整记录策略**:\n\n代码块\n\n**折叠代码块**\n\n**复制**\n\n`-- 按数据完整性保留记录\nSELECT * FROM (\n    SELECT *,\n        CASE WHEN execution_income IS NOT NULL AND order_income IS NOT NULL THEN 1\n            WHEN execution_income IS NOT NULL THEN 2\n            ELSE 3 END as completeness_rank,\n        ROW_NUMBER() OVER (\n            PARTITION BY advertiser_id, project_code ORDER BY completeness_rank, update_timestamp DESC\n        ) as rn\n    FROM ads_pub_ad_ams_execution_income_df WHERE imp_date = '20240513'\n``) WHERE rn = 1`",
