   "question": "数据重复问题的来源分析 · 重复率监控指标",
   "answer": "**重复率计算逻辑**:\n\n代码块\n\n**折叠代码块**\n\n**复制**\n\n`-- 重复率 = (总记录数 - 去重记录数) / 总记录数\nSELECT imp_date,\n    COUNT(\n`*`) as total_count,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT advertiser_id, project_code, xs_buying_type) as distinct_count,\n    (COUNT(\n`*`) - COUNT(DISTINCT advertiser_id, project_code, xs_buying_type)) / COUNT(*) as duplicate_rate\nFROM ads_pub_ad_ams_execution_income_df\nWHERE imp_date = '20240513'\n``GROUP BY imp_date`\n\n**多字段重复率监控**:\n\n代码块\n\n**折叠代码块**\n\n**复制**\n\n`-- 维表主键重复率监控\nSELECT imp_date,\n    table_name,\n    (COUNT(1) - COUNT(DISTINCT primary_key_fields)) / COUNT(1) as duplicate_rate\nFROM dimension_tables\nWHERE imp_date = '20240513'\nGROUP BY imp_date, table_name\n``HAVING duplicate_rate > 0.01  -- 重复率超过1%告警`",
